# A table indexed by a field with an alternative the table has no entry for.
-- source.cue --
t: "a" | "b" | "c"
-- target.cue --
u: 1 | 2
-- lens.cue --
_T: {a: 1, b: 2}
input: _
result: {u: _T[input.t]}
-- out --
not total
result.u indexes a table by input.t, which may be "c", for which the table has no entry (rule table-key-missing) @ lens.cue:3:13
